Rule 15 (All color values should be in range [0, 1])
{v_3 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_3, 0) - 1] : ∀j ∈ [0, shape(v_3, 1) - 1] : 0 ≤ shape(v_3, 0) ∧ shape(v_3, 0) ≤ 1
>>
Rule 16 (Bounding box coordinates should be in range [0, 1])
{v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) - 1] : ∀j ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 1) - 1] : ∀k ∈ [0, 3] : 0 ≤ shape(v_2, 0) ∧ shape(v_2, 0) ≤ 1
>>
Rule 17 (ymin of bounding box should be smaller than ymax)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) - 1] : ∀j ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 1) - 1] : shape(v_2, 0) ≤ shape(v_2, 1)
>>
Rule 19 (batch size of images and boxes should be the same)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
